      "tex": "\\subsection{Proof of Proposition~\\ref{prop:WP}} The proof of Proposition \\ref{prop:WP} is relatively long, and we decompose it into several steps."
    },
    {
      "line": 1621,
      "number": "4.3",
      "tex": "\\subsection{End of the proof of Theorem~\\ref{t:main}} By the results of Section \\ref{s:proofsufficiency}, we only need to prove that if $T\\leq T_\\GCC(\\overline{U})$, the observability inequality \\eqref{obs} does not hold."
